{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 2, "end_sec": 65.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000002", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 57.5, "text": "所以说我跟他严格讲没有见过面的意义上,所以他说给我见过面纯粹的胡扯的,纯粹的胡扯的。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 3, "end_sec": 75.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000003", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 66.5, "text": "我给大家重申一下,这个潘石屹先生啊,为了钱什么都能给别人送过去,这个人是挺有意思的。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 4, "end_sec": 87.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000004", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 75.5, "text": "特别他原来那个首创的刘晓光先生,他说刘晓光先生,吃饭钱都没有,这个还得他对,他的这个这个对钱。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 5, "end_sec": 101.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000005", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 87.5, "text": "我今天给咱们推手们说一句啊,这个在预言坛总参加数捐,三号楼,十一楼,十一A,有一个刘晓光的房子。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 6, "end_sec": 111.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000006", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 101.5, "text": "刘晓光的房子,刘晓光的岳父岳母住在那里,十一楼,十一A,这个房子大家可以去查一查,那是刘晓光的房子。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 7, "end_sec": 118.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000007", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 111.5, "text": "我再可以到处查一查,有没有记错。那个房子里边的古董,玉石,那得多少钱呢?", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 8, "end_sec": 128.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000008", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 118.5, "text": "中纪委查刘晓光房子的时候多少套房子啊?结果潘石屹先生竟然说,他连饭钱都没有,还要潘石屹先生给他。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
