{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 11, "end_sec": 154.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000011", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 148.5, "text": "他就该判无期,人都死了我就不说那么多了,保了那么多人。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 12, "end_sec": 164.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000012", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 154.5, "text": "可是呢,潘石屹先生竟然能说出那样的话出来,说这个刘晓光先生连饭都吃不起,你太开玩笑了。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
