{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 14, "end_sec": 178.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000014", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 172.5, "text": "天下有这么把人当傻子的吗?甭说是你刘晓光这样的身份,", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 15, "end_sec": 184.5, "id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000015", "live_id": "LIVE_20170522_002", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 178.5, "text": "是不是?首创集团在你手里控制,你自己下几百套房子。", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20170522_002_asr_raw_zh_001"}
